        "original_id": "97268524-1760-522f-888e-81fa3a171718",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Idris Elba, David Simon, Nelson Mandela\n- Works: The Wire, Luther, Mandela: Long Walk to Freedom\n- Organizations: HBO, BBC One\n- Roles: Stringer Bell, DCI John Luther\n\nFacts:\n- The Wire was created and primarily written by David Simon.\n- The Wire was broadcast in the United States by HBO.\n- In 2013, Idris Elba played Nelson Mandela in the biographical film Mandela: Long Walk to Freedom.\n- Idris Elba is known for playing Stringer Bell in the HBO series The Wire.\n- Idris Elba is known for playing DCI John Luther in the BBC One series Luther.",
